          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Since being off medication, increased binge episodes most nights for the last 4 weeks, particularly large takeaway meals after late shifts; eats until uncomfortably full and then feels guilty and 'gross'."
      }
    },
    {
